{"id":4647,"title":"一键到达 | 数学基础复习课","content":"<p>任何学习都是一个过程，需要不断复习，以强化理解。</p>\n<p>从今天开始，我会带你复习专栏的内容。按照专栏的七个模块，我为你把每个模块里发布过的文章要点卡都梳理出来，你可以用来回顾每一篇的内容。点击要点卡，一键到达你最需要温故的那一篇。</p>\n<p>今天来复习专栏的第一部分内容，<span class=\"orange\">数学基础</span>。在这个模块里，我们一起学习了线性代数、概率论、数理统计、最优化方法、信息论和形式逻辑这几个内容。</p>\n<p>复习的过程中，还有什么困惑，获得了什么收获，都欢迎你继续给我留言。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1340\"><img src=\"./images/4647_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1341\"><img src=\"./images/4647_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1498\"><img src=\"./images/4647_3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1507\"><img src=\"./images/4647_4.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1573\"><img src=\"./images/4647_5.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1639\"><img src=\"./images/4647_6.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<!-- [[[read_end]]] -->\n<p><a href=\"https://time.geekbang.org/column/article/1807\"><img src=\"./images/4647_7.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":3964,"user_name":"池建强","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000012,"ip_address":"","ucode":"0E359BFB3AC329","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/42/4c/1d5c1263.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1521078043,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100003101,"comment_content":"不是结束了吗？居然还有复习了，赚大了","like_count":11},{"had_liked":false,"id":4377,"user_name":"Andy","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1012037,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D69ED1BAF42262","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/71/45/abb7bfe3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1522062954,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100003101,"comment_content":"